latex-hw licensing

Code in src/, bin/, scripts/, demo/ and test/:
  MIT License (see below), except where a file says otherwise.
  - src/legacy/ and parts of src/mathjax.js, src/mirror-set.js, src/dictionary.js are
    ported from Othman Shuqair's latex-svg project (the RTL mirroring code) by its owner.
  - src/arabic.js is modelled on Tegaki's harfbuzz shaper (MIT, Gokhan Kurt; LICENSES/MIT-Tegaki.txt).

Fonts and stroke data in fonts/ are NOT under MIT:
  - fonts/caveat-math/: Caveat Math (Caveat + added math symbols) and its Tegaki stroke data,
    SIL Open Font License 1.1 (LICENSES/OFL-Caveat-Math.txt). Copyright 2014 The Caveat Project Authors.
  - fonts/amiri/: Amiri (full font and the Tegaki subset) and Tegaki's Amiri stroke data,
    SIL Open Font License 1.1 (LICENSES/OFL-Amiri.txt). Copyright 2010-2022 The Amiri Project Authors.
  Stroke data derived from a font is distributed under the font's license.

Third-party code (not covered by the MIT grant above; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md):
  - mathjax-full 3.2.2 and mhchemparser 4.2.1, Apache-2.0 (LICENSES/Apache-2.0-MathJax.txt)
  - harfbuzzjs 1.6.2, MIT (LICENSES/MIT-harfbuzzjs.txt)
  They are npm dependencies of the Node package; dist/latex-hw.browser.js bundles them and
  dist/harfbuzz.wasm is copied from harfbuzzjs.

